# Harness runtime (regenerated) — two-tier generated-artifact model (see gates/README.md):
#  Tier 1 (machine-only snapshots: status JSON/XLSX) -> always gitignore, never track.
#  Tier 2 (human-readable status, e.g. the dashboard) -> gitignore it (as below) OR track it
#          with an idempotent generator + a self-healing consistency gate.
# Generators are idempotent regardless, so even an un-ignored Tier-2 file never churns the tree.
# Proven in OceanMate (artifact-lifecycle overhaul) + Taxera (idempotency + venv-python, PR #160).
harness/DASHBOARD.md
harness/status/
*.snapshot.json
.harness/locks/
